# JS and JSON are read back as text by the offline tests, and a pattern that holds
# a bare \n stops matching when the checkout wrote \r\n: the Windows runner made
# twelve of them fail on every commit for weeks (found 2026-11-27).
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.py text eol=lf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
